<title>JAPAN: King Jim - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>King Jim - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to December 20, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
